  "findings": {
    "26": "D5 B4 G4 melody eighths slurred first-to-third, fingers5 and2 at ends. Upper sixteenth rest then D4/G-natural4 dyad at1/4, unprinted accompaniment silence thereafter. Bass G2 then G3/B3 dyads at1/4,1/2,3/4 and G3/B-flat3 at1,5/4. Pedal release at initial bass, not staccato. Printed lower finger pairs1/2 near second and fifth attacks (Phase1 relative-attack wording imprecise); retain exact print anchoring for correction. Audiveris extra short slur into accompaniment and lower staccatos unsupported. Both readers omit melody fingers and some lower fingers; PlayScore omits pedal release.",
    "27": "E4 quarter then A4 eighth, fingers3/5; phrase slur initial E4 to P028 initial F#4. Upper D4 at1/4,1/2,3/4 with initial finger1, rest at1, C#4/E4 final dyad fingers2/3. Bass A2 then five E3/G3/A3 chords, finger1 near top of first chord; bracket-like annotation remains uncertain. PlayScore omits D4 at1/2 and final G3. Audiveris misses most fingers and mistakes copyright footer for musical direction. Printed copyright remains metadata.",
    "28": "F#4 dotted eighth then F#4 A4 D5 sixteenths, initial finger4, next finger1; last three staccato and crescendo. Incoming P027 slur ends initial F#4. D3 then five F#3/A3/D4 lower chords. Audiveris misses fingers; compare wedge endpoints to printed late group rather than trusting reader offsets.",
    "29": "F#5 E5 D5 melody eighths, slur first-to-third. Upper interleaved F#4/A4 dyads at1/4,3/4,5/4; shared melody noteheads at0,1/2,1, not two separately printed notes. D3 then five A3/C-natural4/D4 chords, top finger1 on first chord; bracket-like annotation uncertain. sf and Ped. Both readers note pitches agree with print; PlayScore f is wrong and omits pedal/fingering.",
    "30": "D5 B4 G4 eighths slurred first-to-third below melody, last finger1. Lower G3 then five B3/D4 dyads. dimin. and pedal release at first bass. Audiveris lower staccato and garbled text are wrong; PlayScore extra shorter slur to middle note and bass finger5 unsupported, omits pedal/text."
